{%- comment -%} Styles live in assets/ha-sections.css, loaded once in layout/theme.liquid. {%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — HOMEPAGE 02 / FOUNDER NOTE & SIGNATURE.
  Aloha's Hartwick_Homepage_Editorial artboard, 19 September 2026, §02:

      "The note is proposed founder copy for Angela to approve. The cursive
       angela hartwick signature is a temporary typeset design placeholder,
       not her real signature. Replace its named layer with the original
       Angela supplies on Monday before publishing."

  Centred: a Porter eyebrow, one Junicode heading, the statement, then the
  signature and a record-voice caption. The signature is an image slot; until
  the real one is picked, the typeset placeholder is shown from assets/ (it
  is not a real signature and must not go live), and the placeholder notice
  says so. The moment an image is chosen the asset is never referenced.
  The asset was cut from the artboard on 19 September; on 21 September Aloha
  sent her own file for it ("fake signature.png", transparent) and that
  replaced it — still a stand-in, by her own name for it.

  The signature is decorative — the caption beneath already names her — so
  its alt is empty and the caption is the accessible text.

  Aloha, 23 September 2026 (remade homepage, Downloads/Asset 1.pdf): the page
  now OPENS on this note — "01 / The Product Experience", "Made to be worn.",
  two paragraphs and "Cloth. Handwork. Everyday life." — on a sheet of paper
  a shade darker than the page, tall enough to fill the first screen, while
  she chooses the photograph that will go at the top. Style "Opening" draws
  that: the paper panel, eyebrow and heading as one block centred on the
  page, the paragraphs set left in a centred column, the tagline in italic.
  "Founder note" is the 19 September layout, kept for Angela's note.

  Aloha, 24 September 2026 ("FINAL HOMEPAGE HEADER"): the photograph is
  chosen — her collage of a shirt on a hanger against a stone wall, clipped
  to a sheet of paper, with a sheet of glassine laid over its left side. The
  same words sit on the glassine ("Waiting on copy for text. but for now
  just use whats there"). Style "Photograph" draws it: on a desktop the
  picture fills the band and the text is placed on the glassine, in
  percentages of the picture, so it stays on the sheet at any width; on a
  phone the sheet is too small to hold two paragraphs, so the picture comes
  first and the words follow on the paper panel beneath it.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign note_style = section.settings.style | default: 'founder' -%}
<section class="ha-home ha-home-note ha-home-note--{{ note_style }}">
  <div class="{% if note_style == 'photograph' %}ha-home-note__frame{% else %}ha-wrap{% endif %}">
    {%- render 'ha-placeholder-note', show: section.settings.show_placeholder_note, text: 'Placeholder — proposed founder copy awaiting Angela; the signature is a typeset stand-in, not her real signature.' -%}

    {%- capture note_inner -%}
    <div class="ha-home-note__inner">
      <div class="ha-home-note__head">
        {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="ha-home__eyebrow ha-identify">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="ha-home__heading ha-narrate">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if section.settings.body != blank -%}
        <div class="ha-home-note__body ha-home__lead ha-narrate">{{ section.settings.body }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.tagline != blank -%}
        <p class="ha-home-note__tagline ha-narrate ha-pull">{{ section.settings.tagline }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.signature -%}
        {{
          section.settings.signature
          | image_url: width: 900
          | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '320px', widths: '320, 640, 900', alt: '', class: 'ha-home-note__signature'
        }}
      {%- elsif section.settings.signature_asset != blank -%}
        <img
          class="ha-home-note__signature ha-home-note__signature--placeholder"
          src="{{ section.settings.signature_asset | asset_url }}"
          alt=""
          width="900"
          height="225"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.caption != blank -%}
        <p class="ha-home-note__caption ha-identify">{{ section.settings.caption }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    {%- endcapture -%}

    {%- if note_style == 'photograph' -%}
      <div class="ha-home-note__stage">
        {%- if section.settings.image -%}
          {{
            section.settings.image
            | image_url: width: 2296
            | image_tag: class: 'ha-home-note__photo', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', sizes: '100vw', widths: '750, 1100, 1440, 1800, 2296', alt: section.settings.image_alt
          }}
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="ha-figure ha-figure--empty ha-home-note__photo"><span class="ha-figure__label ha-record">01 / The opening photograph</span></span>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="ha-home-note__sheet">{{ note_inner }}</div>
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      {{ note_inner }}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "HA — Home: Founder note",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "ha-section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "style", "label": "Style", "default": "founder",
      "options": [
        { "value": "photograph", "label": "Photograph (24 Sep homepage)" },
        { "value": "opening", "label": "Opening (23 Sep homepage)" },
        { "value": "founder", "label": "Founder note (19 Sep)" }
      ],
      "info": "Photograph: Aloha's collage fills the band and the text sits on its glassine sheet (on a phone, beneath it). Opening: a paper panel filling the first screen, the heading in capitals, paragraphs set left, an italic tagline."
    },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Photograph (Photograph style)", "info": "Aloha's collage. The text is placed on its glassine sheet at fixed positions: a different picture needs them re-measured." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "image_alt", "label": "Photograph alt text", "default": "A cream shirt on a wooden hanger against a stone wall, the photograph clipped to a sheet of paper with a sheet of glassine laid over it" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "A note from Hartwick" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "The work begins with people." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "body", "label": "Statement", "default": "<p>I choose pieces for the way they are made and the people behind them. The cloth, the handwork and the small differences matter. Hartwick Atelier brings that work together, with time to understand where it comes from and how it can become part of everyday life.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tagline", "label": "Tagline (italic, closing)" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Signature" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "signature", "label": "Signature (PNG with transparency)", "info": "Angela's own signature. Until it is picked, the typeset placeholder below is shown." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signature_asset", "label": "Placeholder file (theme asset)", "default": "ha-signature-placeholder.png", "info": "Typeset stand-in supplied by Aloha, not Angela's hand. Clear this once the real signature is in." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "caption", "label": "Caption", "default": "Angela Hartwick / Founder" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Provisional content" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_placeholder_note", "label": "Show placeholder notice", "default": true }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "HA — Home: Founder note" }]
}
{% endschema %}
